ont that works with Salla requires completely different code than one for Shopify or WooCommerce. Switching payment providers means rewriting your checkout.",[129,141,142],{},"CommerceJS solves this with three core ideas:",[144,145,146,154,164],"ol",{},[147,148,149,153],"li",{},[150,151,152],"strong",{},"Unified types"," — A single data model for products, carts, orders, and customers that works across every platform.",[147,155,156,159,160,163],{},[150,157,158],{},"Adapter pattern"," — Each platform implements the ",[161,162,104],"code",{}," interface, mapping its API to the unified types.",[147,165,166,169,170,172],{},[150,167,168],{},"Pluggable providers"," — Payment providers implement the ",[161,171,99],{}," interface, making them interchangeable.",[133,174,176],{"id":175},"package-ecosystem","Package Ecosystem",[129,178,179],{},"The toolkit is organized as a monorepo of focused packages:",[181,182,183,196],"table",{},[184,185,186],"thead",{},[187,188,189,193],"tr",{},[190,191,192],"th",{},"Package",[190,194,195],{},"Purpose",[197,198,199,209,218,227,236,245],"tbody",{},[187,200,201,206],{},[202,203,204],"td",{},[161,205,47],{},[202,207,208],{},"Unified data model — 20+ domain types",[187,210,211,215],{},[202,212,213],{},[161,214,52],{},[202,216,217],{},"CheckoutSession state machine",[187,219,220,224],{},[202,221,222],{},[161,223,57],{},[202,225,226],{},"Tap Payments provider",[187,228,229,233],{},[202,230,231],{},[161,232,62],{},[202,234,235],{},"Cryptographic webhook verification",[187,237,238,242],{},[202,239,240],{},[161,241,67],{},[202,243,244],{},"Salla platform adapter",[187,246,247,251],{},[202,248,249],{},[161,250,72],{},[202,252,253],{},"Ready-to-deploy Nuxt checkout page",[133,255,257],{"id":256},"who-is-this-for","Who Is This For?",[129,259,260],{},"CommerceJS is designed for developers building:",[262,263,264,270,276,282],"ul",{},[147,265,266,269],{},[150,267,268],{},"Storefronts"," that need to work with multiple eCommerce backends",[147,271,272,275],{},[150,273,274],{},"Checkout flows"," with pluggable payment providers",[147,277,278,281],{},[150,279,280],{},"Multi-tenant platforms"," where each merchant uses a different payment gateway",[147,283,284,287],{},[150,285,286],{},"Headless commerce"," applications that need a clean separation between frontend and backend",[133,289,291],{"id":290},"next-steps","Next Steps",[293,294,295,302,308],"card-group",{},[296,297,299],"card",{"icon":298,"title":13,"to":14},"i-lucide-download",[129,300,301],{},"Set up the monorepo and install dependencies.",[296,303,305],{"icon":304,"title":17,"to":18},"i-lucide-rocket",[129,306,307],{},"Process your first payment in 5 minutes.",[296,309,311],{"icon":310,"title":22,"to":28},"i-lucide-layers",[129,312,313],{},"Understand how the packages fit together.",{"title":315,"searchDepth":316,"depth":317,"links":318},"",1,2,[319,320,321,322],{"id":135,"depth":317,"text":136},{"id":175,"depth":317,"text":176},{"id":256,"depth":317,"text":257},{"id":290,"depth":317,"text":291},"CommerceJS is a modular, provider-agnostic eCommerce toolkit for JavaScript and TypeScript.","md",null,{},{"icon":11},{"title":10,"description":323},"tknea1ezeddAZxhgqC_6x8P0yYuBgPrCpQznj5M-8R4",[325,331],{"title":13,"path":14,"stem":15,"description":332,"children":-1},"Set up the CommerceJS monorepo and install all dependencies.",1770686014164]